---
description: "General StudyHub conventions"
alwaysApply: true
---

StudyHub is a service for tracking a department's lab assignments.
Monorepo: apps/web (Next.js 15, TypeScript), apps/api (FastAPI, Python 3.12),
packages/shared (shared types).

- Respond in English; identifiers and code comments are in English as well.
- Before changes in several files, propose a plan and wait for approval.
- Do not modify migrations that have already been merged in apps/api/alembic/versions/: a new schema change means a new Alembic revision.
- Do not add dependencies without explaining why they are needed.
- Secrets, .env and students' personal data must not end up in prompts or logs.
- All API paths have the /api/v1 prefix (it is set by app/main.py, not by individual routers).
